{"text": "SAVANNAH NEWS-PRESS\nP. 0. BOX 1088\n\nSAVANNAH, GA,\n\nJune 10, 1971\n\nLeber, Katz, Partners, Inc,\n767 Fifth Avenue\nNew York, N.Y. 10022\n\nDear Sirs:\n\nToday the Savannah News*Prees mailed out the enclosed letter to\n50 of the Savannah area retail grocery stores on Vantage Cigarettes,\n\nWe were most happy to do this and certainly hope thia will help to\nmerchandise your client's product for him.\n\nThank you very much for the orders you send us,\n\nSincerely yours,\n\nMarion H, Manson\nNational Adverticing Manager\n\nMHMiiw\ncc: Mr. Bob Gillespie\n\nBranham-Molot\nChicago, Ulinois\n\nInc,\n\ncet Mr, Bob McCorkle\nBranham-Moloney, Inc,\nNew York, N. Y.\n\ncect Mr, Leonard Bolton\nBranham-Moloney, Inc.\nAtlanta, Georg!\n\ncc: Mr, Bobby O'N\nVantage Cigarett\n#8 Yorkshire Place\nSavannah, Georgian 31406\n\n6S08 E\u00a300S", "words": [{"text": "SAVANNAH", "x0": 279, "y0": 54, "x1": 341, "y1": 66, "conf": 84.0}, {"text": "NEWS-PRESS", "x0": 349, "y0": 52, "x1": 425, "y1": 64, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "P.", "x0": 301, "y0": 72, "x1": 308, "y1": 79, "conf": 72.0}, {"text": "0.", "x0": 318, "y0": 71, "x1": 326, "y1": 79, "conf": 67.0}, {"text": "BOX", "x0": 337, "y0": 71, "x1": 363, "y1": 78, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1088", "x0": 372, "y0": 70, "x1": 401, "y1": 78, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "SAVANNAH,", "x0": 306, "y0": 85, "x1": 371, "y1": 98, "conf": 82.0}, {"text": "GA,", "x0": 380, "y0": 85, "x1": 399, "y1": 96, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "June", "x0": 451, "y0": 167, "x1": 482, "y1": 178, "conf": 78.0}, {"text": "10,", "x0": 490, "y0": 167, "x1": 509, "y1": 180, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "1971", "x0": 520, "y0": 167, "x1": 549, "y1": 178, "conf": 72.0}, {"text": "Leber,", "x0": 147, "y0": 246, "x1": 194, "y1": 258, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Katz,", "x0": 203, "y0": 246, "x1": 240, "y1": 257, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "Partners,", "x0": 251, "y0": 246, "x1": 319, "y1": 257, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Inc,", "x0": 329, "y0": 245, "x1": 355, "y1": 256, "conf": 91.0}, 